<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scŭtŭlātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		1. scutula, II., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>diamond-</i> or <i>lozenge-shaped</i>, <i>checkered</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rete (aranearum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 24, 28, § 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pavimentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 25, 61, § 185</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of stuffs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					48, 73, § 191</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color equi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 13, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Isid. 12, 1, 48</span></i>.—As
				<i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scŭtŭlāta</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>a checked</i> or
				<i>chequered garment</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caerulea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 2,
					97</span></i>
			; Cod. Th. 15, 7, 11; also: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scŭtŭlāta</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ezech.
				27, 16</span></i>.</div>
